"If you have more than two layouts and turn this option on, switching with the "
"keyboard shortcut or clicking on the kxkb indicator will only cycle through "
"the last few layouts. You can specify the number of layouts to rotate below. "
"You can still access all layouts by right-clicking on the kxkb indicator."
